- P17: CONTRACT: ActivityEntry.Undo (DataMember "undo") = ActivityUndoData { token, type(profile|stack|custom|binding|builtin|tool), id, before(JSON hoac null neu tao moi), afterHash(SHA256 hex JSON chuan hoa; "" neu da xoa), also[] (cac doi tuong phu cung thao tac, vd register_tool = tool + binding) }. Chu ky (Core/Agents/ActivityUndo.cs): Capture(Workspace, ToolStore) -> UndoSnapshot; Build(before, after) -> ActivityUndoData|null; CanUndo(entry, Workspace, ToolStore, out reason); IsUndone(entry, log); Undo(entry, workspacesPath, toolsPath, activityPath) -> message (kiem lai + ap dung + ghi dong nhat ky).
- P17: CONTRACT: danh dau da hoan tac = dong nhat ky MOI Action="undo", UndoOf=<token cua dong goc> (ActivityEntry.UndoOf, DataMember "undoOf"); khong sua dong cu. GUI coi dong goc la "da hoan tac" neu co dong undo tro ve token.
- P17: McpServer.cs khong nam trong touches nen "ban truoc" duoc chup trong AgentError() (McpServer.Agents.cs, goi truoc Dispatch) bang snapshot ca workspace + kho tool; RecordActivity so snapshot sau, chi co undo khi thao tac khong loi, khong pending, va co doi tuong doi.
- P17: INVARIANT: hoan tac chi chay khi hash doi tuong HIEN TAI == afterHash; lech thi tu choi "da bi sua sau do". set_worktree/chay lenh khong co undo. unregister_tool toan may chi khoi phuc ToolEntry, khong gan lai vao cac workspace.
